{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_1","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"【經】","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_2","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"十有八年春王三月，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_3","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"夏，公追戎于濟西。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_4","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"秋，有{或虫}。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_5","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"冬十月。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_6","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"【傳】","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_7","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"十八年春，虢公、晉侯朝王，王饗醴，命之宥，皆賜玉五瑴，馬三匹。非禮也。王命諸侯，名位不同，禮亦異數，不以禮假人。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_8","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"虢公、晉侯、鄭伯使原莊公逆王后于陳。陳媯歸于京師，實惠后。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_9","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"夏，公追戎於濟西。不言其來，諱之也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_10","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"秋，有{或虫}，為災也。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_ttr_47_11","chapterId":"ch_work_ttr_47","textTraditional":"初，楚武王克權，使鬬緡尹之。以叛，圍而殺之。遷權於那處，使閻敖尹之。及文王即位，與巴人伐申，而驚其師。巴人叛楚而伐那處，取之，遂門于楚。閻敖游涌而逸。楚子殺之，其族為亂。冬，巴人因之以伐楚。","sentenceOrder":11}],"overrides":{}}